{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n1++ 慶州國寶級韓牛+濟州黑毛豬\n</p>\n<h2>尖沙咀新開正宗韓式乾濕熟成燒肉店！</h2>\n<p>由香港資深韓餐主理人 Chef Jim Kim 全新打造的正宗韓式乾濕熟成肉燒肉店「熟成屋」，正式登陸尖沙咀韓國街。品牌嚴選慶州千年韓牛、慶州高級豬肉、濟州黑毛豬三大韓國原產頂級食材，搭配專業乾濕熟成技術，於恆溫恆濕無菌熟成櫃長時間熟成，透過肉品天然 酵素分解多餘纖維、濃縮牛油香，風味濃厚立體、餘韻悠長 ，勢必成為最新話題性的韓式精緻燒烤新地標。</p>\n<h2>尖沙咀新開正宗韓式乾濕熟成燒肉店！</h2>\n<p>來到一定要食有「韓國國寶級韓牛」美譽的慶州千年韓牛，肉品多達 1++頂級等級，油花細密分佈均勻、牛油香濃厚純正，肉質軟滑甘香，是韓國高端烤肉專門店的御用頂級牛源；同屬慶州頂級畜產體系的慶州高級豬肉，於韓國優質養殖環境長大，肉質緊實彈嫩、 油脂清爽不膩、腥味極低。經熟成工序鎖住肉汁後，風味乾淨醇厚，口感細緻 Juicy， 極適合燒烤食用。</p>\n<p>熟成屋<br/>\n地址：尖沙咀金巴利街 1K 號 MW One 地舖<br/>\n官方IG：@sukseongok.tst</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334002389149371_18806430556ae432780f132.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334002389149371_18806430556ae432780f132.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334002581553051_4527821676ae4327a43162.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334002581553051_4527821676ae4327a43162.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334002994394201_19890779546ae4327e1ff09.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334002994394201_19890779546ae4327e1ff09.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003145812036_9307520726ae4327f990c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003145812036_9307520726ae4327f990c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003315384194_6774885806ae432814d69a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003315384194_6774885806ae432814d69a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003454547080_21142678936ae43282ba257.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003454547080_21142678936ae43282ba257.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003616629726_6352975486ae4328459125.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334003616629726_6352975486ae4328459125.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfGnsAMAWgw/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:31.695685+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":592,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:17.054424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:17.054424+00:00",